  "description": "Classical machine learning for the browser, sklearn-API compatible. DecisionTree, KMeans, PCA, scalers, encoders, KFold, SpatialKFold, CLR/ILR/ALR compositional transforms. Pure JS hot loops, alpack-routed matrix decompositions, mimic-io JSON serialization. No pyodide, no server, runs from file://.",
